      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Viscara?  Green, lotsa woods, the odd mountain range.  Plenty of local wildlife, most of which tries to kill you. But hardly a death world, the colony below's doing pretty okay.  Good mineral yields here, so reckon we'll be around for a good while yet. \n\nSeems a lot of Jedi around, though, and the other lot.  Not sure what's so interesting about this ball of rock to the likes of them. But there must be something, given how many turn up. ",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
