      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Pretty standard mining station.  Or it was, till everything went mad lately.  Civvies nearly all cleared out, just waiting for them to order us down to the maintenance area to clean out the mining droids, they've all gone haywire.  Reckon it's sabotage, one of Czerka's rivals hacking us.  Exchange maybe, they're right bastards they are. ",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
